Through this victory, Philadelphia placed itself at the top of the Eastern Conference.
Montreal Jaroslav Špaček's Czech defender was injured in the game against Buffalo and retired in the second third because of an upper-body injury.
In addition to their experienced Beck, the Candiens also paid their lead an unlost in the penalty shootout 2:3.
