Excavation pit caught on fire in embassy district
A fire broke out in an excavation pit in the embassy district in Tiergarten on Saturday.
As the police announced, at around 12.00 o'clock during welding work in the Tiergartenstraße construction material ignited.
As a result, a large cloud of smoke, which could also be seen well from a distance.
