Police officers found the seriously injured man lying in the street and alerted the emergency doctor.
The man had to be taken to a hospital.
Father attacks tram driver - child had to watch
In front of his four-year-old son, a drunk father insulted a female tram driver on Friday night and subsequently punched him.
As the police announced on Saturday, the 49-year-old BVG employee had to stop in the Seestraße in Wedding, when she was suddenly attacked by the 30-year-old.
In the process, the man punched her in the face with his fist while the child had to watch.
Police officers briefly arrested the drunk, the boy had to be picked up by the grandfather.
