Hungry Labrador turns on hotplate - apartment fire
A hungry dog has probably triggered an apartment fire in Brandenburg/Havel.
The Labrador had probably jumped on the stove to get food, as the police announced on Friday.
He probably moved the switch and switched on a plate.
Paper on the stove caught fire.
The apartment on the fourth floor of an apartment building was on fire on Thursday afternoon.
